        <p class="mt-4 text-text-secondary max-w-xl mx-auto sm:mx-0">Neuroscience, engineering, and computing — brought together by curiosity and a desire to understand the brain.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-start">
        <!-- Left: Focus Areas (Tabs) -->
        <div class="space-y-4" role="tablist" aria-label="Society Focus Areas">
