            </h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Understanding the brain — from neural pathways to cognitive processes and biological systems.</p>
          </button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-1" id="tab-1" data-index="1" class="focus-tab focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan text-left w-full p-6 rounded-2xl border border-transparent hover:border-border-subtle hover:bg-surface-alt transition-all duration-300 opacity-70 hover:opacity-100">
