              <span class="text-gold text-2xl">⚡</span> Brain-Computer Interfaces
            </h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">EEG, neural signal processing, and the technology translating thought into action.</p>
          </button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-2" id="tab-2" data-index="2" class="focus-tab focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-cyan text-left w-full p-6 rounded-2xl border border-transparent hover:border-border-subtle hover:bg-surface-alt transition-all duration-300 opacity-70 hover:opacity-100">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-2 text-text-primary flex items-center gap-3">
